<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed higher in heavy trading Thursday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 83.12 to 6823.86.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 5.11 to 411.20.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.53.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 1543 to 910.</p>
<p>Volume was 520,401,700 compared with 496,352,420 on Wednesday.</p>
